<title>USA: Omaha cattle up $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle up $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were active, prices were $0.50 to $1.00 higher.</p>
<p>Steers - select to choice 2-4 1050-1300 lbs 66.50-67.50. Select 63.00-66.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - couple loads mostly choice 2-4 around 1100 lbs 68.00. Select to choice 975-1200 lbs 66.00-67.50. Select 61.50-65.00.</p>
</text>
